    "Let’s define your goal and help you with daily food and activity tips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让我们一起设定你的目标，并为你提供每日饮食和运动建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let’s make your goal healthier. Your current plan results in too few daily calories to safely support your body. Try a more gradual timeline for better, lasting results." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让我们一起制定一个更健康的目标。你当前的计划导致每日摄入热量过低，可能无法安全地支持身体运作。建议尝试更循序渐进的时间表，以获得更持久的成果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light enough to win every high jump competition… and maybe float away if you're not careful" : {
      "localizations" : {
