    },
    "We believe in full transparency. Here’s exactly how your daily calorie targets and activity levels are computed — based on gold-standard health science used by registered dietitians and medical professionals worldwide." : {

    },
    "We multiply your BMR by a physical activity level (PAL) based on your chosen strategy:\n\n• Eat Less → Sedentary (×1.20)  \n• Balanced → Moderately Active (×1.55)  \n• Move More → Very Active (×1.725)  \n\nThis gives us your Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE)." : {

    },
    "We need a bit more data before we can offer insights. Keep logging your records to unlock personalized trends!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我们还需要更多数据，才能为你提供洞察分析。继续记录，解锁专属趋势！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeighPoint" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WeighPoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WeighPoint uses an intelligent analysis engine to help you understand the *context* behind your weight. It looks for patterns between your recovery, activity, and scale weight to differentiate between fat loss, water retention, and muscle repair." : {

    },
    "Weight" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weight"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
