    },
    "Weight Trend" : {

    },
    "What to prioritize today" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日重点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While our system uses advanced logic to interpret your data, it is an estimation tool, not a medical diagnosis.\n\n• **We don't know everything:** We can't see what you ate (sodium intake), your hydration levels, or external life stress.\n• **Every body is different:** Some people recover faster than others. The AI uses general physiological baselines that apply to most, but perhaps not all.\n• **Data Quality:** The insight is only as good as the data entered. Missing sleep or workout logs may lead to generic advice." : {

    },
    "You can edit your goal to fine-tune your daily food and activity tips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以编辑目标，以微调每日的饮食与运动建议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You reached %lld%% of your goal - %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You reached %1$lld%% of your goal - %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已达成目标的 %1$lld%% —— %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your health plan is built using reliable, evidence-based formulas — not guesswork. We use your personal data and combine it with medically accepted calculations to deliver a safe and effective path to your goals.\n\n🔐 **Your privacy matters.**  \nAll calculations are done directly on your device. **We do not collect, store, or see any of your personal health data.** Everything stays local and private to you.\n\nEverything is backed by peer-reviewed research and health organization standards.\n\nWant to go deeper? You can explore the linked sources above or talk to a healthcare professional for tailored advice." : {

    },
